    <ul class="fit-flags" style="margin-bottom:10px"><li>Never a true max — every set stops with reps left.</li><li>Stop any set where form breaks or something hurts. It still counts.</li><li>Be honest about reps in reserve: the whole test depends on it.</li></ul>
