    <div class="sub" style="margin-bottom:8px">${D.grip.mode === 'bar' ? 'Barbell at bodyweight from knee height, double overhand, no straps, no hook. Stand it up and time until it slips or goes down.' : 'The fallback if a bodyweight bar isn\'t safe to stand up: hang from a bar, time until you let go. Scored on the bar-hold cutoffs, so not like for like.'}</div>
